### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@supermarket.rw",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### 3. First barcode lookup — cacheHit: false
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/barcode/6001000000017
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Second barcode lookup — cacheHit: true
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/barcode/6001000000017
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Benchmark
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/barcode/6001000000017/benchmark?iterations=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Audit log (MongoDB proof)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. RBAC test — no token, expect 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/barcode/6001000000017